<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Mosaic Routine</title>
<meta name="description" content="Slide through a few questions and get one routine built from every Mosaic Wellness brand, with one bag and one checkout.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='16' fill='%2317594C'/%3E%3Cpath d='M14 44V26a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v18M30 44V26a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v18' stroke='%23fff' stroke-width='6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<style>
:root{
  --ink:#11302A; --primary:#17594C; --primary-2:#1F6E5E; --accent:#2A8C78; --mint:#E8F3EE; --mint-2:#D4EAE1;
  --bg:#F5F9F7; --surface:#FFFFFF; --line:#DCE8E2; --muted:#5B6F68; --soft:#8A9C95;
  --mm:#1D3D6B; --bw:#A8436A; --rl:#5F6F25; --lj:#D9622F;
  --radius:18px; --shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(17,48,42,.06),0 8px 24px rgba(17,48,42,.06);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.5;min-height:100vh;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
h1,h2,h3,h4,.display{font-family:Manrope,Inter,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.15}
button{font:inherit;color:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:none}
a{color:var(--primary)}
.wrap{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px}
/* top bar */
.top{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:rgba(245,249,247,.88);backdrop-filter:saturate(1.4) blur(10px);border-bottom:1px solid transparent;transition:border-color .2s}
.top.scrolled{border-bottom-color:var(--line)}
.top .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:60px}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:Manrope;font-weight:800;font-size:17px;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}
.logo svg{flex:none}
.logo small{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--accent);text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:-2px}
.bagbtn{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:600;font-size:14px}
.bagbtn .count{min-width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--primary);color:#fff;font-size:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:0 6px}
/* screens */
.screen{display:none;padding:20px 0 140px;animation:fade .35s ease}
.screen.active{display:block}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
/* landing */
.hero{padding:28px 0 8px}
.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);background:var(--mint);padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(34px,8.5vw,46px);font-weight:800;margin:18px 0 14px}
.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent)}
.hero p.lead{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);max-width:30em}
.brands{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:22px 0 26px}
.bchip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;flex:none}
.cta{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;width:100%;padding:17px 22px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--primary);color:#fff;font-family:Manrope;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(23,89,76,.25);transition:transform .12s,background .2s}
.cta:hover{background:var(--primary-2)}
.cta:active{transform:scale(.985)}
.cta[disabled]{opacity:.5;pointer-events:none}
.cta.ghost{background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:none}
.how{display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:30px}
.howi{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px}
.howi .n{flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--mint);color:var(--primary);font-family:Manrope;font-weight:800;display:grid;place-items:center}
.howi b{display:block;font-family:Manrope;font-size:15px}
.howi span{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
.fineprint{font-size:12px;color:var(--soft);margin-top:22px;text-align:center}
/* quiz */
.progress{display:flex;gap:6px;margin:6px 0 22px}
.progress i{flex:1;height:5px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--line);overflow:hidden;position:relative}
.progress i{transition:background .3s}.progress i.on{background:var(--accent)}
.qhead .step{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase}
.qhead h2{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;margin:6px 0 4px}
.qhead p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:18px}
.card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.q{padding:18px;margin-bottom:12px}
.q label.ql{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:2px}
.q .val{font-family:Manrope;font-weight:800;font-size:20px;color:var(--primary);min-height:28px;transition:color .2s}
.q .ends{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--soft);margin-top:6px}
input[type=range]{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:100%;height:36px;background:transparent;margin-top:8px;touch-action:pan-y}
input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-runnable-track{height:10px;border-radius:5px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent) var(--p,50%),var(--mint-2) var(--p,50%))}
input[type=range]::-moz-range-track{height:10px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--mint-2)}
input[type=range]::-moz-range-progress{height:10px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--accent)}
input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--primary);margin-top:-10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(17,48,42,.25);transition:transform .15s}
input[type=range]::-moz-range-thumb{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--primary);box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(17,48,42,.25)}
input[type=range]:active::-webkit-slider-thumb{transform:scale(1.12)}
input[type=range]:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:4px;border-radius:6px}
.seg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:10px}
.seg button{padding:16px;border-radius:14px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);font-family:Manrope;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;transition:all .15s}
.seg button.on{border-color:var(--primary);background:var(--mint);color:var(--primary)}
.seg button small{display:block;font-family:Inter;font-weight:500;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
.dock{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:30;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(245,249,247,0),var(--bg) 30%);padding:26px 0 calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}
.dock .wrap{display:flex;gap:10px}
.dock .back{flex:none;width:56px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;place-items:center}
/* loading */
.loading{min-height:60vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;gap:18px}
.tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,22px);gap:6px}
.tiles i{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--mint-2);animation:tile 1.2s infinite ease-in-out}
.tiles i:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.1s}.tiles i:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.2s}.tiles i:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.3s}.tiles i:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.4s}.tiles i:nth-child(6){animation-delay:.5s}.tiles i:nth-child(7){animation-delay:.6s}.tiles i:nth-child(8){animation-delay:.7s}.tiles i:nth-child(9){animation-delay:.8s}
@keyframes tile{0%,100%{background:var(--mint-2)}40%{background:var(--accent)}}
.loading p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;min-height:24px}
/* results */
.rhero{padding:8px 0 4px}
.rhero h1{font-size:32px;font-weight:800;margin:12px 0 10px}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:10px 0 14px}
.chip{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--mint);color:var(--primary)}
.summary{font-size:15.5px;color:var(--ink)}
.summary b{font-weight:600}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;margin:18px 0 8px}
.stat{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:12px 8px;text-align:center}
.stat b{display:block;font-family:Manrope;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary)}
.stat span{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.section{margin-top:30px}
.section h3{font-size:21px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:4px}
.section .sub{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;background:var(--mint);padding:5px;border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:14px;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none}
.tabs::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.tabs button{flex:1;white-space:nowrap;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px}
.tabs button.on{background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(17,48,42,.1)}
.tabs button .c{font-size:11px;background:var(--mint-2);color:var(--primary);border-radius:8px;padding:1px 6px}
.steps{position:relative}
.stepc{display:grid;grid-template-columns:36px 1fr;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px}
.stepc .num{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--primary);color:#fff;font-family:Manrope;font-weight:800;display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative;z-index:1}
.stepc:not(:last-child) .num::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:40px;left:17px;width:2px;height:calc(100% + 0px);background:var(--line);z-index:-1}
.stepc .rail{position:relative}
.pcard{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.pcard .kind{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}
.pcard .row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
.pcard h4{font-size:16.5px;font-weight:700;margin:6px 0 2px}
.brandtag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}
.price{font-family:Manrope;font-weight:800;font-size:16px;white-space:nowrap;text-align:right}
.price small{display:block;font-family:Inter;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:var(--soft)}
.why{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink);margin-top:10px;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:12px}
.why b{color:var(--primary)}
.howto{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:8px}
.howto svg{flex:none;margin-top:3px}
.flag{display:inline-block;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:#8A5A00;background:#FFF4DC;border-radius:8px;padding:3px 8px;margin-top:8px}
.plinks{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px}
.plinks a{text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
.empty{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);padding:18px;text-align:center;background:var(--surface);border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius)}
/* timeline */
.tl{position:relative;padding-left:26px}
.tl::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:8px;top:6px;bottom:6px;width:2px;background:linear-gradient(var(--mint-2),var(--accent))}
.tli{position:relative;margin-bottom:14px}
.tli::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-24px;top:16px;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--accent)}
.tli .card{padding:14px 16px}
.tli h5{font-family:Manrope;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:6px}
.tli ul{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:6px}
.tli li{font-size:14px;display:flex;gap:8px}
.tli li .dot{margin-top:7px}
/* left out */
.out{display:grid;gap:8px}
.outi{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:12px 14px}
.outi b{font-size:14px;display:block}
.outi span{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.addbtn{flex:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--mint);color:var(--primary);font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
.addbtn.on{background:var(--primary);color:#fff}
.lj{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;background:#FFF6F0;border:1px solid #F6DCCB;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px}
.lj b{font-family:Manrope}
.lj span{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted)}
/* bag */
.bgroup{margin-bottom:14px}
.bgroup .bh{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.bgroup .bh b{font-family:Manrope;font-size:15px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.bgroup .bh span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.bitem{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.bitem:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.thumb{flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:Manrope;font-weight:800;color:#fff;font-size:13px}
.bitem .bi{flex:1;min-width:0}
.bitem .bi b{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3}
.bitem .bi span{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.qty{display:flex;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}
.qty button{width:30px;height:30px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600}
.qty span{min-width:22px;text-align:center;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}
.totals{padding:16px}
.trow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:14.5px;padding:4px 0}
.trow.save{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}
.trow.grand{font-family:Manrope;font-weight:800;font-size:19px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:8px;padding-top:12px}
.banner{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;background:var(--mint);border-radius:14px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:13.5px;margin-bottom:14px}
.banner b{font-family:Manrope}
/* checkout */
.field{display:block;margin-bottom:12px}
.field span{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px}
.field input,.field textarea{width:100%;font:inherit;font-size:15px;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink)}
.field input:focus,.field textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--accent)}
.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
.opt{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:8px;background:var(--surface);cursor:pointer;width:100%;text-align:left}
.opt.on{border-color:var(--primary);background:var(--mint)}
.opt .radio{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--soft);flex:none;position:relative}
.opt.on .radio{border-color:var(--primary)}
.opt.on .radio::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:3px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--primary)}
.opt b{display:block;font-size:14.5px}
.opt small{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.note{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
/* confirmation */
.done{text-align:center;padding:16px 0 4px}
.tick{width:76px;height:76px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--primary);display:grid;place-items:center;margin:10px auto 18px;animation:pop .5s cubic-bezier(.2,1.6,.4,1)}
@keyframes pop{from{transform:scale(.3);opacity:0}to{transform:none;opacity:1}}
.done h1{font-size:30px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px}
.done p{color:var(--muted)}
.box{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:6px;margin:16px 0}
.journey{display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:8px}
.jrow{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:14px}
.jrow .d{flex:none;width:58px;font-family:Manrope;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);font-size:14px}
.jrow b{display:block;font-size:14.5px}
.jrow span{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.foot{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--soft);text-align:center;padding:26px 16px 0;line-height:1.6}
.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:100px;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:all .25s;z-index:60;white-space:nowrap}
.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%)}
@media (min-width:600px){.screen{padding-top:32px}.hero{padding-top:44px}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="top" id="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="logo" href="#" onclick="go('landing');return false" aria-label="Mosaic Routine home">
      <svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="64" height="64" rx="16" fill="#17594C"/><path d="M14 44V26a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v18M30 44V26a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v18" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      <span>mosaic routine<small>by Mosaic Wellness</small></span>
    </a>
    <button class="bagbtn" onclick="go('bag')" aria-label="Open Mosaic Bag">
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 7h12l-1 13H7L6 7z"/><path d="M9 7a3 3 0 0 1 6 0"/></svg>
      Bag <span class="count" id="bagCount">0</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap">
  <!-- LANDING -->
  <section class="screen active" id="s-landing">
    <div class="hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">60 seconds · no typing</span>
      <h1>Don't know where to start? <em>Slide.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Answer a few questions with sliders. Get one routine built from every Mosaic brand: what to use, in what order, and what you'll see by week 12. Then order it all in one go.</p>
      <div class="brands">
        <span class="bchip"><i class="dot" style="background:var(--mm)"></i>Man Matters</span>
        <span class="bchip"><i class="dot" style="background:var(--bw)"></i>Be Bodywise</span>
        <span class="bchip"><i class="dot" style="background:var(--rl)"></i>Root Labs</span>
        <span class="bchip"><i class="dot" style="background:var(--lj)"></i>Little Joys</span>
      </div>
      <button class="cta" onclick="startQuiz()">Build my routine
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
      <div class="how">
        <div class="howi"><span class="n">1</span><div><b>Slide, don't research</b><span>Five quick screens: skin, hair, body and how much time and money you want to spend.</span></div></div>
        <div class="howi"><span class="n">2</span><div><b>Get one routine across brands</b><span>The best product for each step, whichever Mosaic brand makes it. Morning, night, supplements and wash days, in order.</span></div></div>
        <div class="howi"><span class="n">3</span><div><b>See what changes and when</b><span>A week-by-week timeline so you know what to expect, and why to stick with it.</span></div></div>
        <div class="howi"><span class="n">4</span><div><b>One bag, one checkout</b><span>Products from different brands, one Mosaic order, one delivery.</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- QUIZ -->
  <section class="screen" id="s-quiz">
    <div class="progress" id="progress"></div>
    <div id="qbody"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- LOADING -->
  <section class="screen" id="s-loading">
    <div class="loading">
      <div class="tiles"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
      <h2 class="display" style="font-size:22px">Building your routine</h2>
      <p id="loadMsg">Reading your answers…</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- RESULTS -->
  <section class="screen" id="s-results"></section>

  <!-- BAG -->
  <section class="screen" id="s-bag"></section>

  <!-- CHECKOUT -->
